 explosion said  nothing is going to change  it's simply going to continue he said  but again this is different we've all  been traumatized and he says i think  you're going to see an exodus of people  you're going to see an excellence of  lebanese  wanting to leave the country because  they've never seen anything like this  before  and certainly a lot of people won't have  hope that anything is going to change  any time soon what's happened to the  city peter has been catastrophic it's  going to take billions of dollars to  rebuild  it's an economy that was already in  tatters people have lost  most of their life savings uh you've had  that you have corona on the rise  it is a it's a very sad situation here  at the moment people not very hopeful  at all stephanie decker thank you steph  decker there are correspondent reporting  live  from beirut

